# Trust: Nashmeira (hidden quest TrustNashmeira): a level 99 Warrior in Aht Urhgan Whitegate. The Imperial Whitegate (no
# script; default GATE_IS_FIRMLY_CLOSED). ToAU The Empress Crowned completed (setup). No permit: the default message.
# The Windurst Trust Permit (a GM): 5092 (text_table 0); finished on 1: nothing; again, finished on 2: Nashmeira
# learned, YOU_LEARNED_TRUST. Learned: the default message.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Imperial_Whitegate/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/5092
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=152.8,-4.2,0 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Toau TheEmpressCrowned completed
login
trigger Imperial_Whitegate              # no permit: GATE_IS_FIRMLY_CLOSED
keyitem WindurstTrustPermit             # a GM
trigger Imperial_Whitegate              # 5092
finish option=1                         # not 2: nothing
trigger Imperial_Whitegate              # 5092
finish option=2                         # Nashmeira learned, YOU_LEARNED_TRUST
trigger Imperial_Whitegate              # learned: GATE_IS_FIRMLY_CLOSED
